The present writ petition under Article 226 of the Constitution of India has been filed by the Petitioner with the following reliefs:
"a) Issue appropriate writ, order and/or direction in the nature of Habeas Corpus and thereby directing the release of the Petitioner in relation to case FIR No. 299/2013 registered at P.S Shakarpur.;
This is a digitally signed order.
